  "results": {
    "training_signal": "All four 300-update arms completed with finite telemetry and PPO updates. Scalar return increased but is not comparable across reward scales and did not predict evaluation quality.",
    "control": "Passed hard gates at update 100, failed stationary body rocking at 200, then failed final target error and tilt at 299. Survival, recovery, and arrival LCB remained 0.9852 at all three checkpoints; final-error p95 rose from 1.04 cm to 17.69 cm.",
