    "settled_quality": "Quality weight 8 reduced final-error p95 to 3.12 cm at 299, but recovery LCB was 0, settled-stop LCB was 0 in every cohort, heading p95 was 1.94 rad, and stationary quality failed.",
    "potential_progress": "Potential scale 20 had final-error p95 8.32 cm, but recovery and arrival LCB were 0. The diagnostic suite showed zero arrivals and settled stops in all five cohorts.",
    "decision": "Promote no treatment. Keep the selected actor-only transfer as the quality floor and hold curriculum at stage 0."
  },
  "conclusion": "No tested reward change improved the policy without losing an existing hard gate. Training did not stall: all runs finished with finite telemetry and repeated PPO updates. Returns grew while evaluation quality declined. The current arrival event is not enough to retain precision; a stronger arrival bonus worsened endpoint error, the smooth quality signal improved position while severely damaging heading/recovery/rocking, and the scale-20 potential signal suppressed arrival and recovery. Keep the selected actor-only transfer, hold stage 0, and promote no trained checkpoint.",
